<title>UK: WH Smith sales rise 4.0 pct in for months.</title>
<headline>WH Smith sales rise 4.0 pct in for months.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailer and bookseller W H Smith said on Wednesday that total sales for the group rose four percent for the four months to the end of September.</p>
